# XCU tabs
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.
#
# The page leaves the output undefined when standard output is not a terminal
# and the sequence written to a terminal unspecified, and the driver supplies
# no terminal, so nothing can be observed.

assertion  XCU.tabs.001
anchor     utilities/tabs.html#DESCRIPTION
anchor     utilities/tabs.html#OPTIONS
anchor     utilities/tabs.html#OPERANDS
anchor     utilities/tabs.html#STDOUT
class      untestable
says       tabs clears the terminal tab stops and sets them at the stops named
           by -n, a canned format option or a list operand, for the terminal
           type given by -T or TERM.
reason     The sequence is unspecified, the results are undefined when standard
           output is not a terminal, and an effect on tab stops can only be seen
           on a terminal.
